              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "धड़कन — dhaṛkan — \"a heartbeat\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "धड़कन (dhaṛkan) is a tadbhava, a word inherited and reshaped by sound change. It comes from dhaḍ, \"throb, beat\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 6711). dhaṛkan is the noun of dhaṛaknā, \"to throb\"."
            }
          ]
        },
